{
    "test_name": "MOB.536_AssetVerify_Job_Status_Menu",
    "details": {
        "name": "MOB.536_AssetVerify_Job_Status_Menu",
        "type": "browser",
        "status": "paused",
        "message": "`MOB.536` **The job status menu \u2014 IN PROGRESS \u2192 CANCELED \u2192 IN PROGRESS.**\n- The dot beside the job title offers exactly `Mark as COMPLETED` / `Mark as CANCELED` from\n  IN PROGRESS. CANCELED shows `This verification job has been canceled.`; IN PROGRESS removes it.\n- The mid-state is read in-page (a canceled job may leave the crew's list); the server proof\n  is the reload at the end. COMPLETED is never clicked.\n- \ud83d\uded1 Self-restoring (`always`); `reset_av_fixture.py --apply` is the 0-run fallback.",
        "tags": [
            "Mobile",
            "env:dev",
            "Asset Verification",
            "self-restoring"
        ],
        "locations": [
            "gcp:us-west2"
        ],
